### 8. Aptidão (GESTOR/ADMINISTRADOR) — depende de um usuário existente

### Cadastrar
POST http://localhost:8080/api/v1/aptidoes
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "usuarioId": {{usuarioId}},
  "categoriaProblema": "INFORMATICA",
  "nota": 8.5
}
> {% client.global.set("aptidaoId", response.body.id); %}

### Listar aptidões do usuário
GET http://localhost:8080/api/v1/aptidoes?usuarioId={{usuarioId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Buscar por ID
GET http://localhost:8080/api/v1/aptidoes/{{aptidaoId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Atualizar nota
PATCH http://localhost:8080/api/v1/aptidoes/{{aptidaoId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "nota": 9.0
}

### Desativar / ativar (opcional; altera estado do registro)
PATCH http://localhost:8080/api/v1/aptidoes/{{aptidaoId}}/desativar
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

###
PATCH http://localhost:8080/api/v1/aptidoes/{{aptidaoId}}/ativar
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
